#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:157
msgid "Nothing in FluentCart writes the shipping status automatically — it changes only when someone changes it. This is the safest place for a multi-step fulfilment workflow."
msgstr "FluentCart 沒有任何機制會自動寫入出貨狀態，只有人手動改才會變。多階段的出貨流程放在這一軸最安全。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:177
msgid "Add shipping status"
msgstr "新增出貨狀態"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:184
msgid "Rename or recolour the statuses FluentCart ships with. The stored slug never changes, so nothing else in FluentCart is affected — leave a field blank to keep the original."
msgstr "改 FluentCart 內建狀態的名稱與顏色。資料庫裡存的代碼不會變，因此不影響 FluentCart 其他功能；欄位留空即維持原本的名稱。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:190
msgid "Payment statuses"
msgstr "付款狀態"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:192
msgid "Payment statuses can be renamed but not added to: FluentCart decides download access, refunds, customer lifetime value and every revenue report from this column using hardcoded lists, so a new value would go quietly missing from all of them."
msgstr "付款狀態只能改名，不能新增：FluentCart 用寫死的清單依這個欄位判斷下載權限、退款、顧客終身價值與所有營收報表，新增的值會在這些地方無聲地消失。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:203
msgid "Payment behaviour"
msgstr "付款後行為"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:207
msgid "Restore custom order statuses that FluentCart overwrites when a payment is recorded"
msgstr "當 FluentCart 因收到款項覆寫自訂訂單狀態時，自動還原"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:211
msgid "Applies per status, to the ones set to “Keep after payment”. Switch this off to let FluentCart move every paid order to Processing as it normally would."
msgstr "只作用於設為「付款後保留」的狀態。關閉後，所有已付款訂單都會照 FluentCart 原本的行為變成「處理中」。"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:214
msgid "Before you deactivate"
msgstr "停用前請先確認"

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:216
msgid "Deactivating this plugin does not change a single order row — orders sitting on a custom status keep it, and FluentCart simply shows the raw slug. To clear them out first, move each custom status's orders to a built-in one with the Move button on its row."
msgstr "停用本外掛不會更動任何一筆訂單資料——停在自訂狀態的訂單會保留原值，FluentCart 只會直接顯示代碼。若要先清空，請用各狀態列上的「搬移訂單」按鈕把訂單改到內建狀態。"

